@startuml
!include ../../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/c4/deployment-diagram-style.iuml
title deployment boundaries (proposed; not deployed)
cloud "GitHub.com / GHES" as GH
node "GitHub Actions runner (low privilege)" as RUN {
 rectangle "Offline/synthetic evaluator" as E
}
database "Audited policy source" as PS
node "Separate privileged service (future)" as SV {
 rectangle "GitHub App installation token" as TOK
}
GH --> RUN : read-only API
PS --> RUN : reviewed policy digest
RUN --> SV : evidence only; no direct authority
SV --> GH : privileged API after independent approval
note right of SV : Not provisioned by this suite
@enduml
